OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Potter play producer says
OL,4,Acost of living made two-part show
OL,5,A'impossible'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Harry Potter And The Cursed Child
OL,8,Fproducer has said the rising cost of
OL,9,Fliving made it "literally impossible"
OL,10,Fto retain the play's original format in
OL,11,Ftwo parts.
OL,13,FThe production has been cut down to a
OL,14,Fsingle three-hour show and is set to
OL,15,Fre-open in the West End next month.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
