OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Potter play producer says
OL,4,Acost of living made two-part show
OL,5,A'impossible'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The cost of living has gone up 30-40%
OL,8,Fsince the pandemic, including running
OL,9,Fshows," producer Sonia Friedman said in
OL,10,Fcomments reported by media at a launch
OL,11,Fevent. "The only way we could continue
OL,12,Fto run it as a two-parter would be by
OL,13,Fcharging an amount for the tickets that
OL,14,Fwould be unaffordable and
OL,15,Finaccessible."
OL,17,FThe two-part play, a sequel to JK
OL,18,FRowling's books, premiered in the West
OL,19,FEnd in 2016 and closed on 20 September.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
